---OnClickBtn 点击按钮
---@param go table
---@param isOn boolean
---@protect
function CrossServiceReportItem:OnClickBtn(go, isOn)
    if go == self.go_table.aorbtn_report then
        ActivityTournamentModel:GetInstance():Playback(self.data, 0, 0)
    end
